# Cloudflare Pages redirects for app.cesvu.com
#
# Reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# SvelteKit's static adapter emits a fully-prerendered set of HTML files
# (one per route) under dist/, so this file is intentionally minimal. The
# force-HTTPS row is the only critical one — Cloudflare already issues TLS
# and HTTP/3 at the edge, but this guarantees any HTTP request bounces to
# HTTPS even before the HSTS preload kicks in.

# Force HTTPS for every request.
http://app.cesvu.com/*    https://app.cesvu.com/:splat    301!